    "detailed_description": "A 2D runner-style game where you play as Wiki, a surly and delusional calico cat on a quest to get her dinners back from her owners, &quot;Dad&quot; and &quot;The Girl,&quot; by taking a wild ride through the house on her mighty steed--the family dog!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollect cat treats and cat coins to buy upgrades between runs, and plan out your assaults on the various rooms of the house. The game has 10 &quot;story&quot; levels with unique boss fights, 17 &quot;challenge&quot; levels, and an endless mode.",
